data: {"seq":1502,"ts":"2026-08-22T19:31:56.885Z","id":"call_c0b5de73e1e647da82ec831b","name":"fw_get_function_source","is_error":false,"preview":"{\n \"source\": \"// addr=0x49fa60 name=nasFtpSetUserList arch=mips32be size=0\\nint __fastcall nasFtpSetUserList(int *a1)\\n{\\n  FILE *stream; // [sp+24h] [+24h]\\n  char v3[256]; // [sp+28h] [+28h] BYREF\\n\\n  stream = fopen(\\\"/tmp/vsftp/etc/passwd\\\", \\\"w\\\");\\n  if ( !stream )\\n    return 0;\\n  if ( *a1 > 0 )\\n  {\\n    sprintf(v3, \\\"/tmp/vsftp/root/%s\\\", (const char *)&a1[44 * a1[1] + 2]);\\n    mkdir(v3…(+732 chars)"}

