data: {"seq":1633,"ts":"2026-08-22T19:33:32.150Z","text":"Both FTP user-list functions show `sprintf(s[256], \"/tmp/vsftp/root/%s\", username)` — 256-byte buffer, prefix 17 bytes → overflow needs username ≥ ~238 chars.\n\nBUT — one critical detail: the FTP structure field offsets DIFFER between httpd & uclited versions:\n- uclited nasFtpSetUserList: fprintf \"%s:%s:%d:%d;\" with username @ a1[44i+2], password @ a1[44i+6]\n- httpd nas","stream":true,"block":0}

