data: {"seq":1761,"ts":"2026-08-22T19:38:28.919Z","text":"sub_4255C8 (mode-2 session check):\n- If dword_5E69FC (LAN session flag): compares MAC/identity v4 (from sub_4254B8 - MAC from ARP for IP v1) with session_client (strncmp 0x12 bytes). So session is bound to the **client MAC address** (from ARP) + the session token in session_client. \n- Else (WAN login): checks source IP == dword_5E69DC.\n\nSo auth mode 2 = session tied to client MAC","stream":true,"block":0}

