login is solid-ish. What's the admin password seeded from? The pwd list is built at init from... Let me find the init caller: it must be in httpInit chain — the callees of httpInit included httpPwdConfInit (base) but the httpPwdConfAdd callers might be in \"getHttpBasicRealmWeb\" or a \"WlanPwd\" init. Since I can't resolve the 2 callers by name, try fw_call_trace on httpPwdConfAdd — ambiguous? It's httpd-only function. Try call_trace direction in.","stream":false,"block":0}

