llees) — reboot command → system(\"reboot\")? const. And **tphotplug spawn** — uclited launches tphotplug via execFormatCmd with...? tphotplug args (usb event) — could include partition name from hotplug — local. Skip.\n\n最后一搏 candidate: **httpd 的 STATUS/诊断页以外的 \"swSetPppoe...\"?** — PPPoE WAN 设置: 用户名/密码存配置; pppd 启动在哪? uclited dispatch list: no pppd. Who starts pppd for PPPoE WAN? Maybe busybox \"pppd\" via ipcserver? or httpd直接 system? Search httpd for \"pppd\" string ref (functions calling system with pppd): search pattern \"pppd\" in httpd module functions? We did pppd pattern globally — got pppDnsGet etc only. There might be \"swPppoe\"?? Let me quickly search \"Pppoe\" in httpd/uclited.","stream":true,"block":0}

