tcher function — search vsftpd for \"cmd_table\"-like: search \"cmd_dispatch\"? Earlier vsf_cmdio — search pattern \"dispatch\" in vsftpd.\n\n3. minidlna ParseNameValue 回调 done (bounded). Maybe the remaining: **GetValueFromNameValueList / ClearNameValueList** — allocation-free reads.\n\n4. httpd 未读 userRpm — candidates: **WlanWpsRpm handler**, **Diagnostic? done**, **GuestRpm/TimeRpm**? Let me use effort on **httpd 0x42xxxx helpers** — httpGetVirtualPath read? done. The biggest unread userRpm areas: WLAN security/Basic handlers (they call swWlan* — config-only), **LdapServerRpm?** Let me instead pick concrete: **swWlanSecurityRpm handler** reading WPA key → sets execWlanCmd path (already found v21 overflow). The httpd \"WzdPPPoERpm\" wizard handler may set PPPoE config pre-auth? — wizard path — the PPPoE wizard (0x? for WzdPPPoERpm) sets PPPoE username/password via wizard (maybe pre-auth!). If wizard is pre-auth and sets PPPoE AC/service name → the PPPoE injection become pre-auth-ish (still needs config apply). Find the WzdPPPoE handler: search \"WzdPPPoE\".\n\nLet me start with: uclited stopPhDdns (0x48d368) + search its httpd counterpart startPhDdns; and search \"WzdPPPoE\".","stream":false,"block":0}

