开始：FF 53 4D 42 72 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 62 00 02 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00\n即 SMB header: \\xffSMB (0xff,'S','M','B'), cmd 0x72 (nt negprot), status 0, flags..., then dialect count 2 (\"0x02 0x00\"), dialects (\"NT LM 0.12\"=0x00 0x02 0x04...).\n\n用 payload_hex 直接发这段（不带 NBT","stream":true,"block":0}

