0 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 08 62 00  .............b.\n0020: 02 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  ................\n- \"\\xffSMB\" + cmd 0x72 + status(4B=0) + flags 0x18 + flags2 0x0000c853 + pidHigh 0 + sig(8B=0) + tid 0 + pid 0 + uid 0 + mid 0 + 0x00(wct) + 0x08 62 00?? hmm 0x62 00 = bytecount 0x62=98?? \n\n算了——最稳妥用**标准已知 hex**（很多 PoC 用）：\nnegprot (NT LAN Manager / SMB over TCP 445):\nff534d4272000000001807c80000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000200010000000000000000000000000000\n咦我记不全。\n\n替代：用 NBT **session request**（最常见可触发 smbd 会话层解析）:\n81 00 00 44 —— len 0x44? 标准 session request length=0x44(68): 32 (name) + 32 (called name) + 4 (types)? 其实 session request body = 4B types + 2×32B 名称（\"*SMBSERVER     \"）+。长度 68：\n\n若稳一点：用 payload=\"\\x81\\x00\\x00\\x44","stream":true,"block":0}

