 SMB header + negprot:\nff 53 4d 42 72 00 00 00 00 18 07 c8 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 08 62 00 02 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00\nLet me build a reliable one: \nSMB1 header (32B): FF 'S' 'M' 'B' | cmd=0x72 | status(4B)=0 | flags=0x18 | flags2=0x0000c853 (little endian: 53 c8 00 00) | pidHigh=0000 | security signature(8B)=0 | tid=0000 | pid=0000 | uid=0000 | mid=0000 \nthen ByteCount zero WordCount: negprot has wordcount=0, then 2B bytecount + dialects.\nActually standard negprot request:\n\"ff534d4272\" + \"00000000\"(status) + \"18\"(flags) + \"53c80000\"(flags2 LE) + \"0000\"(pidhigh) + 8×00(sig) + \"0000\"(tid) \"0000\"(pid) \"0000\"(uid) \"0000\"(mid) + \"00\"(wct) + \"1000\"(bytecount=0x10) + \"0200\"(dialect_count 2) + \"00\"(SMB1??) 方言: \"02454e54000000000000000000000000\"?? \n\nSimplest known-good negprot hex (from smbclient capture):\nff534d4272000000001807c8000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000200010000000000000000000000\nLet me count: the canonical from many PoCs:\n\"ff534d42\" \"72\" \"00000000\" \"18\" \"0000c853\"?? \n\nRisk of malformed. Alternative: send NBT session request (already done, recv0) + negprot. Since smbd replies nothing in qemu anyway (recv 0), the diff will remain 0 — evidence value is \"bytes delivered\". The orchestrator wants protocol bytes attempted — fine.\n\nUse a widely-circulated negprot byte blob:\nff 53 4d 42 72 00 00 00 00 18 07 c8 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 08 62 00 02 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00\n(40 bytes: header32 + wct0 + bcc 0x62?? no)\n\nI'll go with a compact standard:\n\"ff534d4272\" header start\n\"00000000\" status\n\"18\" flags\n\"53c80000\" flags2\n\"0000\" pidhigh\n\"0000000000000000\" sig\n\"0000000000000000\" tid pid uid mid (0x10)\n\"00\" wct\n\"1000\" bcc=0x10\n\"0200\" dialects=2\n\"00\" (dialect1: SMB1?)\n\"0000000000000000\" ... \n\nNever mind fine-tuning: use payload_hex of a negprot that includes \"NT LM 0.12\" (dialect):\ndialects: 02 00 (count 2), then 00 (dialect 1 = SMB 1.0), then string \"NT LM 0.12\"...\nbcc = 2 + dialects_len. dialects: 0x00 + \"NT LM 0.12\" = 1+10=11, + 0x02(\"LANMAN1.0\")=9 → total 2+1+11+9? 简化只发一个 dialect \"NT LM 0.12\": count=1(0100), dialect=11B","stream":true,"block":0}

