 \"NT LM 0.12\" (dialect):\ndialects: 02 00 (count 2), then 00 (dialect 1 = SMB 1.0), then string \"NT LM 0.12\"...\nbcc = 2 + dialects_len. dialects: 0x00 + \"NT LM 0.12\" = 1+10=11, + 0x02(\"LANMAN1.0\")=9 → total 2+1+11+9? 简化只发一个 dialect \"NT LM 0.12\": count=1(0100), dialect=11B (\"NT LM 0.12\") → bcc = 2+1+11=14=0e00.\n\nfull:\nheader(32): ff534d42 72 00000000 18 53c80000 0000 0000000000000000 0000000000000000\nwct=00\nbcc=0e00\ncount=0100\n\"00\" (dialect flag byte","stream":true,"block":0}

