\n\n手工 base64(\"openssh-key-v1\\0...\") 头 15B→ 20 base64 chars: \"b3BlbnNzaC1rZXktdjEA\" 是 \"openssh-key-v1\" 无 NUL。+\"AA\" = \\x00 → \"b3BlbnNzaC1rZXktdjEAAA==\"? 15B: \"openssh-key-v1\\0\"=15B → base64 20 chars \"b3BlbnNzaC1rZXktdjEAAA==\"。后面接畸形字段 base64 (00000000→\"AAAAAA==\"...)。\n\n拼 base64 文本: \"b3BlbnNzaC1rZXktdjEAAA==\" + \"AAAAAA==\"(cipher 4B) + \"AAAAAA==\"(kdf) + \"AAAAAQ==\"(nkeys=1) + \"AAAAAA==\"(keylen0) + \"AAAA/w==\"(blob_len=0xffffff00? 4B big-endian ff ff ff 00 → base64 \"////AA==\") + \"QUFBQQ==\"(blob 41414141)。\n\n拼接文本（每行<76）:\n-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----\nb3BlbnNzaC1rZXktdjEAAA==AAAAAA==AAAAAA==AAAAAQ==AAAAAA==////AA==QUFBQQ==\n-----END OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----\n\ndropbearconvert 拿到后 import_read","stream":true,"block":0}

