data: {"seq":0,"ts":"2026-08-22T22:47:57.608Z","session_id":"s-mt4rda4n-55d3","agent_id":"dsh-fwgraph","task":"沿高分攻击路径做动静结合挖掘，给出调用链和可复现 PoC。优先命令注入和内存破坏。上一轮已入库 F-mt4ljkg4-bede（bpalogin 栈溢出，static-only）。请继续挖 httpd/minidlna/dhcp6s 等，必须自己调用 fw_request_trace/fw_get_trace 和 fw_request_fuzz/fw_get_fuzz_run：fuzz 若 status=running 就继续轮询直到 ok/error（120s 跑不是卡死）；函数级 handshake 失败就改整二进制（只传 binary_md5）。record_finding 必须带 call_chain 和 poc。"}

